WEBVTT - Wall Push-Up Guidance

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Stand facing a wall about an arm length away with palms flat at shoulder height.

00:04.000 --> 00:09.000
Bend your elbows smoothly to lower your chest toward the wall in a straight plank.

00:09.000 --> 00:14.000
Keep your elbows angled backward at forty-five degrees without flaring wide.

00:14.000 --> 00:19.000
Push firmly through your palms until arms are straight without locking elbows.

00:19.000 --> 00:25.000
Maintain a steady cadence and keep your body aligned from head to heels.

